687
01:02:18.875 --> 01:02:20.625
- One, two, three!
- One, two, three!

688
01:02:23.792 --> 01:02:25.333
- One, two, three!
- One, two, three!

689
01:02:27.875 --> 01:02:29.750
- One, two, three!
- One, two, three!

690
01:02:32.750 --> 01:02:33.875
- One, two, three!
- One, two, three!

691
